# Runtime environment, resolved through 1Password by scripts/with-secrets.sh.
#
# Anything genuinely secret is an `op://` reference, never a value: this file is
# committed, and a secret pasted here is a secret in the git history forever.
# `op run` substitutes the references at launch, so the process gets the value
# and the disk never does.
#
# Values that are *published by design* are written out. Marking a key secret
# when it ships to every browser that loads the app is not caution, it is a
# habit that makes the real secrets below harder to notice.

# --- The Administration ---

# Which content set `studio corpus build` bakes.
CONTENT_SET_ID=admin-2026w34

# The generation harness's billed driver. `studio scenarios run --driver openrouter`
# refuses without it, so the reference belongs with the rest rather than in a
# shell somebody has to remember to export.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=op://orsmn55mjwru7jkycit6p3cmne/dafetkmn7fmieht4g57eh7dyb4/credential
